<title>UK: House of Fraser to close some stores -FT.</title>
<headline>House of Fraser to close some stores -FT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>House of Fraser Plc will announce plans to close about 10 of its 50 stores when it announces its first-half results on Tuesday, the Financial Times reported.</p>
<p>The stores group could not immediately be reached for comment.</p>
<p>The FT said it expected the stores group to make a hefty restructuring charge and announce extensive job losses following a strategic review of its business.</p>
<p>Analysts believe the group could close the London based DH Evans and Army and Navy Store as well as a number of stores in small provincial towns, according to the paper.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom 44-171-542 7767.</p>
